<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD GERMANY 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN LEAD GERMANY 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MALLORCA, Spain 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain led Germany 2-1 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup World Group first round match on Saturday:</p>
<p>Doubles result (Spanish names first):</p>
<p>Carlos Costa/Alex Corretja lost to Marc Goellner/David Prinosil</p>
<p>2-6 2-6 3-6</p>
</text>
